/-- 21:C2, 21:C5, 21:C16 — the register on `𝔽₁₃` (`κ = 3`, drive `2`): `4κ = 12 = −1`, `G = 6` with
`2G = −1`, `c² = 7` with `2c² = 1`, `ħ = 2³ = 8 = −i` with `ħ² = −1` (the frame's `quarterTurn` is `5`), the root `r = 8 · 7 = 4` with `r² = 3 = κ` and
